    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/unique-freelancer-portfolio/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Unique Freelancer Portfolio is free and specially crafted considering the unique needs of freelancers who want to showcase their work professionally. It offers a sleek and modern design which can be beneficial for tough competition amongst competitors. The theme is most suitable for writers, photographers, designers, developers, artists, and professionals looking to build a personal website, online portfolio, creative portfolio, digital resume, UX/UI portfolio, portfolio website, or project showcase. It supports portfolio branding, portfolio presentation, multimedia display, and portfolio documentation to help display work samples effectively. The Homepage offers an excellent header section that includes an announcement bar, a horizontal menu bar, and an attractive banner to represent your core skills to potential clients. A special section to showcase past projects with short descriptions helps in building credibility and trust among clients. Built with the Contact Form 7 plugin for easy communication, it allows customization without coding while ensuring functionality for lead generation. A dedicated and highly functional contact form plays an important role in engaging clients and capturing customer data. Additionally, responsive design, SEO-friendly structure, and fast performance ensure easy access to the website on any type of device while improving visibility on search engines."
    },
